( C86 + C88 {F4 T6f, 2026-10-19}: post_element_force at an interior
  section {x=2, middle 2 0.5} of the C84 4x1 quad4 strip {fixed at x=0,
  loads velx 50 and vely 5 at the x=4 corners} with a -spring1 {stiffness
  1e2, direction 0 1} at the section node 3. The spring1 centroid lies
  on the section plane and counts on the positive side: the Professional
  02-08-2026 gives normal 100, shear0 5.496710893081, moment0 -20 {spring
  force 4.5033}. Before C88 the GNU spring1 force was 21.17 {node-distance
  elongation, stale right-hand-side index}. Targets: the Professional. )
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
materi_stress
